---
---

<section id="comenzar" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- BG -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-950/20 to-navy-900/50"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none">
    <div class="w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-emerald-600/10 rounded-full blur-[140px]"></div>
  </div>
  <!-- Grid -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <div data-reveal class="space-y-6">
      <div class="section-badge justify-center">Comienza hoy</div>
      <h2 class="heading-xl text-balance">
        El cumplimiento de<br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">tus hijos empieza hoy</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Únete a los padres que ya usan Cuotela para cumplir con sus obligaciones alimentarias de forma transparente, certificada y directa. <strong class="text-white">El primer mes es gratis.</strong>
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a href="https://app.cuotela.co/registro" class="btn-primary text-base px-8 py-4 animate-glow">
          Crear cuenta gratis — sin tarjeta
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#asesoria" class="btn-outline text-base px-8 py-4">
          Hablar con un abogado
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Social proof -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 pt-6 text-xs text-slate-500">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex -space-x-2">
            {['🧑🏽', '👩🏻', '👨🏾', '👩🏼'].map(emoji => (
              <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
                {emoji}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <span>+500 padres registrados</span>
        </div>
        <div>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 4.9/5 satisfacción</div>
        <div>🔒 Datos 100% seguros</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
